058 - Hark, the Vesper Hymn Is Stealing
 / 
Key: Eb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 58
Topic: Worship - 

Verse 1:
[Gm]Hark! [Ab]the [Gm]vesper hymn [Fm]is [Eb]stealing
[Gm]O'er [Bb]the waters [Ab]soft [Fm]and [Ddim]clear;
[Eb]Jubilate, [Bb7/Ab]Jubilate, [Eb]Jubilate, [Bb7/Ab]Amen.

Verse 2:
[Gm]Nearer yet, [Bb7]and [Gm/Bb]nearer [Eb]pealing,
[Gm]Soft [Bb]it breaks [Gm]upon [Fm]the [Ddim]ear.
[Eb]Jubilate, [Bb7/Ab]Jubilate, [Eb]Jubilate, [Bb7/Ab]Amen.
